  "body": "**What.** A Reiterer-Trubowitz-style computer-assisted existence proof of the discretely self-similar critical solution at one D (say 40-60), with the certified solution inside the basin of Theorem B's construction (PROOF.md \u00a76, layer C).\n\n**Why.** Corollary C needs the computed branch to be Theorem B's branch.\n\n**Done when.** A certified enclosure of the solution and of \u0394 at that D, containing our double-double value, reviewed.",
