   "body": "Coordinator: see #91. Reiterer and Trubowitz (arXiv:1203.3766, \"Choptuik's critical spacetime exists\") wrote the equations in variables where they are at most quadratic, which keeps the Newton remainder an exact quadratic form. That is the structure a certified finite-D solution needs, so #91's verdict bears on the method chosen here.",
